## Date and Number Formatting

### 1. Locale-Aware Formatting
```dart
// Date formatting
final dateFormat = DateFormat.yMMMd(locale.languageCode);
final formattedDate = dateFormat.format(DateTime.now());

// Number formatting
final numberFormat = NumberFormat.currency(
  locale: locale.languageCode,
  symbol: locale.languageCode == 'bn' ? '৳' : '\$',
);
final formattedAmount = numberFormat.format(amount);
```

### 2. Currency Formatting
```dart
// Bengali currency
if (locale.languageCode == 'bn') {
  return '৳${amount.toStringAsFixed(2)}';
} else {
  return '\$${amount.toStringAsFixed(2)}';
}
```

## Error Messages

### 1. Localized Error Messages
```dart
// Use ErrorHandler with localized messages
ErrorHandler.handleError(
  context,
  error,
  message: l10n.errorGeneric,
  onRetry: () => retry(),
)
```

### 2. Form Validation Messages
```dart
String? validateAmount(String? value) {
  if (value?.isEmpty == true) {
    return l10n.required;
  }
  final amount = double.tryParse(value!);
  if (amount == null || amount <= 0) {
    return l10n.invalidAmount;
  }
  return null;
}
```

## Testing Localization

### 1. Test Different Locales
```dart
testWidgets('should display Bengali text', (tester) async {
  await tester.pumpWidget(
    ProviderScope(
      overrides: [
        localeProvider.overrideWith((ref) => Locale('bn')),
      ],
      child: MaterialApp(
        localizationsDelegates: AppLocalizations.localizationsDelegates,
        supportedLocales: AppLocalizations.supportedLocales,
        home: MyWidget(),
      ),
    ),
  );
  
  expect(find.text('বাংলা'), findsOneWidget);
});
```

### 2. Test Locale Switching
```dart
testWidgets('should switch locale on button tap', (tester) async {
  await tester.pumpWidget(MyApp());
  
  // Initially English
  expect(find.text('English'), findsOneWidget);
  
  // Tap language toggle
  await tester.tap(find.byKey(Key('language_toggle')));
  await tester.pump();
  
  // Should switch to Bengali
  expect(find.text('বাংলা'), findsOneWidget);
});
```

